                {
                    "id": "700470101",
                    "speaker": "Ajaw",
                    "text": "Hey, Kinich. Look who's here."
                },
                {
                    "id": "700470102",
                    "speaker": "Ajaw",
                    "text": "#{NICKNAME}! The Almighty Dragonlord, K'uhul Ajaw demands you to attend him at once!"
                },
                {
                    "id": "700470103",
                    "speaker": "Kinich",
                    "text": "#We meet again, {NICKNAME}."
                },
                {
                    "id": "700470104",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "You seem well."
                },
                {
                    "id": "700470105",
                    "speaker": "Ajaw",
                    "text": "I am anything BUT well! My dullard servant has spent the last few hours staring at colorful paper scraps... The boredom is killing me!"
                },
                {
                    "id": "700470106",
                    "speaker": "Kinich",
                    "text": "These \"paper scraps\" are decorations, and they look like they're made out of cardboard. They're quite interesting.",
                    "choices": [
                        {
                            "id": "700470107",
                            "text": "You like the decor around here, Kinich?",
                            "response": [
                                {
                                    "id": "700470109",
                                    "speaker": "Kinich",
                                    "text": "I'd say I do. I think this cardboard would make a fitting home for Ajaw."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "700470110",
                                    "speaker": "Ajaw",
                                    "text": "You mean to imply I'm some sort of paper dragon?"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "700470111",
                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                    "text": "You spend so much time being banished, the inside of a cardboard box should feel like home to you by now."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "700470112",
                                    "speaker": "Ajaw",
                                    "text": "K—Kiniiiiiich! Just you wait, you'll be on your knees, begging for forgiveness, when you behold the true majesty of the Dragonlord K'uhul Ajaw!"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "700470113",
                                    "speaker": "Kinich",
                                    "text": "Until then, I'll be sure to take in the majesty of the little paper dragonlord K'uhul Ajaw."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "700470114",
                                    "speaker": "Kinich",
                                    "text": "#{NICKNAME}, I see you've brought a Kamera with you. Would you mind taking a photo of this paper theater for me?"
                                },
                                {
